---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import { release, url } from '../lib/publication';
---
<Site title="Journalist desk"><PageHeader title="The journalist desk" eyebrow="Reuse & reporting" description="Trace a finding to its source, reuse approved data with its dates, and ask the next document-based question." /><section class="section"><div class="shell grid-2"><div><h2>Available for reuse</h2><p>The published snapshot contains {release.observations.length} approved observations and {release.claims.length} approved claim records. A blank snapshot should never be cited as evidence of normal conditions.</p><div class="button-row"><a class="button" href={url('/downloads/observations.csv')} download>Download observations CSV</a><a class="button button-light" href={url('/downloads/manifest.json')} download>Download manifest</a></div><p class="small muted">Each approved row includes period, unit, geography and source ID. The bundle records release and review dates. Use the original source's rights terms for any source material.</p></div><div class="empty-panel"><h3>Before quoting a chart or table</h3><ol><li>Open its exact evidence record.</li><li>Check observation and publication dates.</li><li>Read the geographic and definitional limits.</li><li>State when an inference extends beyond the measurement.</li></ol><a href={url('/methodology/')}>Read the full method ↗</a></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow">Document request bank · drafts, not sent</p><h2>Questions worth putting on record</h2><div class="grid-3"><article class="editorial-card"><h3>Which source serves whom?</h3><p>Ask a utility for source-wise volumes, service boundaries, interruptions and quality testing by date.</p></article><article class="editorial-card"><h3>What stage has a response reached?</h3><p>Request the actual notification, sanction, fund release, completion record and measured outcome separately.</p></article><article class="editorial-card"><h3>What does the network miss?</h3><p>Ask for station lists, observation gaps, changes in monitoring inventory and explanations of revisions.</p></article></div><p class="small muted" style="margin-top:2rem">No external request or interview has been conducted by this site from these prompts.</p></div></section></Site>
